          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "BlendMode",
          "ranges": [
            [
              43,
              63
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "这是给定最终状态的条件公式，未冒充实际截图；alpha0 RGB仍可受lightmap/overlay/fog改变。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "B07",
      "finding": "默认CompositeState是COLOR_DEPTH_WRITE，但true/true的setup本身不强制恢复depthMask，只在false时关闭。无discard的alpha0片元仍可能在通过深度测试且depthMask true时写深度。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "RenderType",
          "ranges": [
            [
              563,
              576
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "RenderStateShard",
          "ranges": [
            [
              145,
              151
            ],
            [
              553,
              579
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "RenderSystem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              239,
              242
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "GlStateManager",
          "ranges": [
            [
              85,
              92
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "不把alpha0等同完全无副作用；前序depthMask和可见面遮挡尚需实际状态采样。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "B08",
      "finding": "ClientLevel普通非乘客tick在调用entity.tick前setOldPosAndRot并增加tickCount；不调用super.tick的自定义tick不代表客户端xOld/tickCount永远不更新。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "ClientLevel",
          "ranges": [
            [
              251,
              280
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "BallistaBolt",
          "ranges": [
            [
              69,
              77
            ],
            [
              154,
              183
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "只闭合客户端正常tickingEntities路径；不推广为服务端所有Entity基类副作用都会补做。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "B09",
      "finding": "LevelRenderer.renderEntity先lerp(xOld,getX,t)再减相机坐标；dispatcher添加renderOffset并translate后调用自定义renderer。因此B10未读的上游位置插值已补到具体消费者。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "LevelRenderer",
          "ranges": [
            [
              1435,
              1441
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "EntityRenderDispatcher",
          "ranges": [
            [
              130,
              140
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "玩家特殊路径/自定义外部调用和网络纠偏未运行。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "B10",
      "finding": "弩矢renderer在0.2缩放之后额外translate(dx*t,dy*t,dz*t)，而dx是本类tick开头getX减上次保存x；这不是上游同一插值的纯重复调用。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "BallistaBoltRenderer",
          "ranges": [
            [
              34,
              55
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "BallistaBolt",
          "ranges": [
            [
              69,
              76
            ],
            [
              154,
              156
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "LevelRenderer",
          "ranges": [
            [
              1435,
              1440
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "普通dispatcher+默认zero renderOffset前提下，原点近似lerp(old,current,t)+(0,.125,0)+.2*d*t；d并不保证就是当前速度。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "B11",
      "finding": "在无纠偏且恒速、d与本tick位移均为v的特例，附加位移为0.2*v*t，不能说成完整两倍速度。旋转仍用current+diff*t向前推，区别于last到current插值。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "BallistaBoltRenderer",
          "ranges": [
            [
              39,
              51
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "BallistaBolt",
          "ranges": [
            [
              158,
              181
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "仅明示特例与公式，未给真实抖动/偏差实测值。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
